WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:19.932
Na farko, ƙwayoyin rai suna amfani da ƙwayoyin halitta guda uku na 64 don adana ƙa'idodin rayuwa, kuma teburin bincike na dijital na shigarwa 6 suna amfani da maɓallin 64 daidai.

2
00:00:20.272 --> 00:00:35.007
Na biyu, rukuni na saitunan maɓallin makwabta guda huɗu tare suna ɗaukar ƙananan firikwensin ko maganganun kalmomi yayin kawar da sautin sautin sauti mai ƙarfi.

3
00:00:35.347 --> 00:00:55.778
Na uku, ƙwaƙwalwar 16 kilobyte tana gudanar da ƙwarewar da aka tabbatar a cikin nanoseconds daga microcontrollers na dala 4 zuwa katunan kewayawa na M.2 ba tare da fan ba, farka manyan samfuran kawai akan sabon abu na gaske.
